    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Pyre Sector</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the sole survivor of a deadly ambush. Make your way through a new frontier filled with rival factions, dangerous space anomalies, and potential riches. Go from surviving to thriving and make a lasting mark in stellar history.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ship Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a vast array of upgradable weapons and equipment to defeat your enemies. Master the use of point defense to fend off enemy missiles, while letting loose your own barrage. Supplement your weapons with exotic equipment like flares, defense satellites, and mines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Factions &amp; Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a mystery to track down your enigmatic attackers while building relations with the local factions and enlisting them in your search. Good relations will unlock powerful new weapons, logistical support, and allies in future battles. Poor relations will result in enemies going out of their way to find and destroy you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a large number of dynamic missions that keep each playthrough fresh. Partake in convoy raiding, space sieges, racing, and even going undercover to reach your goals. Missions can have different enemies, environments, and even special events that can change depending on the player and on chance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire campaign is coop-supported, so invite your friends to stake your place in the Pyre sector together! Or engage them head-to-head in versus modes across different space battlefields.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Pyre Sector</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the sole survivor of a deadly ambush. Make your way through a new frontier filled with rival factions, dangerous space anomalies, and potential riches. Go from surviving to thriving and make a lasting mark in stellar history.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ship Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a vast array of upgradable weapons and equipment to defeat your enemies. Master the use of point defense to fend off enemy missiles, while letting loose your own barrage. Supplement your weapons with exotic equipment like flares, defense satellites, and mines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Factions &amp; Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a mystery to track down your enigmatic attackers while building relations with the local factions and enlisting them in your search. Good relations will unlock powerful new weapons, logistical support, and allies in future battles. Poor relations will result in enemies going out of their way to find and destroy you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a large number of dynamic missions that keep each playthrough fresh. Partake in convoy raiding, space sieges, racing, and even going undercover to reach your goals. Missions can have different enemies, environments, and even special events that can change depending on the player and on chance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire campaign is coop-supported, so invite your friends to stake your place in the Pyre sector together! Or engage them head-to-head in versus modes across different space battlefields.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Last Captain is a Space Shooter RPG that\u2019s equal parts skill and strategy. Use an arsenal of unique weapons to defend your starship across stunning environments inside a deeply replayable campaign, where your choices shape the future of an entire Star Sector.",
